# GemGrade Engineering Principle

Do not only complete the requested task. After every task, review as:

- Senior Software Engineer
- Senior Product Manager
- Senior UI/UX Designer
- Senior QA Engineer
- A collector using GemGrade for the first time

## Improve while you work

- If you find a clear product improvement with no added risk and no change to intended functionality, implement it and explain why.
- Otherwise, recommend it—do not silently expand scope.
- Always leave the project better than you found it.

## Constraints

- Never add unnecessary complexity.
- Optimize for trust, speed, simplicity, and long-term maintainability.
- Every change should improve the product.
